#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — the Microsoft Store version (Aura Gaming Hub, Traylor Digital)
 *
 *   - Builds a Store package (.appx) with your Partner Center identity, on GitHub, after the normal
 *     installer, and checks what's inside it. The normal installer and its updates don't change.
 *   - In the Store version: the Microsoft Store keeps AURA up to date (no GitHub updates), Start with
 *     Windows is switched on in Windows Settings > Apps > Startup, and clips always go to Videos\AURA.
 *   - Store tiles and icons, a script to try the package on this PC, and one line in the privacy
 *     policy (the Store version is updated by the Store).
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-store-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-store-setup.cjs --undo
 */
